#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The AUC measures how well a model ranks good above bad credits, independent "
"of a decision threshold, which makes it the most informative metric on this "
"imbalanced dataset (70% good credits). In Kipu Quantum's benchmarks, the "
"quantum-transformed features on their own reached an AUC similar to the "
"classical baseline, and the hybrid model, which combines both, reached the "
"highest AUC and F1 score. The quantum-transformed features therefore add "
"information that the classical features do not provide on their own.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Clean up (optional) {#clean-up-optional}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A fitted mapping stays available until you delete it. If you do not want to "
"map further data with it, delete it. A deletion does no quantum work, uses "
"no QPU time, and cannot be undone.\n"
msgstr ""

