#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Key takeaways {#key-takeaways}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Rimay fits into an existing machine learning pipeline as one additional "
"preprocessing step. You keep your data preparation and your classical "
"model.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The number of qubits bounds the number of input features, and the number of "
"rows times `shots` bounds the size of a single job.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the quantum-transformed features combined with the original features as "
"a default, because the model can use both.\n"
msgstr ""

